WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.169 --> 00:00:06.339
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No siccing 049 on people!

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:12.030
SCP-049, the Plague Doctor, is often well-intentioned,
aiming to cure people of what ails them, but

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.259
the cures he implements tend to do a lot more
harm than good.

00:00:15.259 --> 00:00:20.490
So, Dr. Bright should NOT encourage any random
D-Class or inexperienced interns to cough

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:25.390
in front of SCP-049, nor should he loudly
remark "Are you okay?

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:29.189
You look a little sick..." where 049 can hear
him.

00:00:29.189 --> 00:00:34.280
What goes around comes around, Doctor, and
flu season is just around the corner.

